{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents27OUDSLinearProgressIndicatorV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0"}],"title":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Variants","type":"heading","text":"Variants","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two variants are provided:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the caller provides a ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value in ","type":"text"},{"code":"[0, 1]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion time or percentage."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Statuses","type":"heading","text":"Statuses","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}]},{"text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"onboarding).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrieval)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monitored.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Gap size","level":2,"anchor":"Gap-size","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}]},{"text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Track","level":2,"anchor":"Track","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)","type":"heading","anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Helper text","type":"heading","anchor":"Helper-text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the progress bar to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" which offers two variants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" parameter controls horizontal alignment (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".percent(description:alignment:)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The percentage value and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75%\""},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"type":"text","text":" in Arabic)."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), only the percentage is shown, centered.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the percentage is at the leading edge and the description (if provided) at the trailing edge.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"type":"text","text":", the description (if provided) is at the leading edge and the percentage at the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is a simple "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"type":"text","text":" with a separate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperTextAlignment"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" (default): The text is centered under the progress bar.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The text is aligned to the leading edge.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The text is aligned to the trailing edge.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Animation","anchor":"Animation","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": when ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the target ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"text":"Determinate — Basic usage","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Determinate-Basic-usage"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: .description(\"Uploading…\"))","","    \/\/ Description aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\", alignment: .end))","","    \/\/ Percentage centered (default)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .percent())","","    \/\/ Percentage with description at start (percentage leading, description trailing)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                helperText: .percent(description: \"of 100 MB\", alignment: .start))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")","","    \/\/ Helper text aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                helperText: \"Loading data…\",","                                helperTextAlignment: .end)","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with accessibility","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"loading\", state: \"processing\"))"]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.name"},{"type":"text","text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)","type":"text"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads: "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". Example: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibility","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}]},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“75 percent”","type":"text"}]},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".updatesFrequently"},{"text":" trait so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" is provided, it is exposed as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indicator never captures ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}]},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"text":" trait is used.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","text":"Colored surfaces","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}]},{"text":" rendering, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-linear-progress-indicator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"inlineContent":